entity.description:
Celebration Maven is a client appreciation concierge service. In essence that means we do – 

-	Corporate gifts of all types and prices - Personally sourced and / or customised to suit the individuality of the recipient;
-	Gourmet & wine hampers - Designed to compliment your corporate identity incl branded greeting cards, gift wrap and gift boxes;
-	Event planning; 
-	Event favours & wedding bonbonniere;
-	Corporate entertainment .

BUT we do it with a firm focus on – 

-	Customisation, personalisation, branding and marketing strategy;
-	Cost effectiveness and return on investment;
-	How this advances your relationship with your client and interprets to long term loyal clients. 

Companies spend thousands of dollars every year on “thank-you for your business” gifts (especially at Christmas) and client entertaining such as golf days and sports tickets. It is an expense that is usually made because a company thinks they “have to” and is given the least amount of strategic thought. This is where Celebration Maven comes in. We develop gifts and entertainment that are personalised, customised, branded and focused on your marketing strategy to get the best return on investment. Call it the “customer experience”, “relationship marketing”, “customer appreciation” or just “CRM”, Celebration Maven is about so much more than generic gourmet hampers at Christmas. 

“One customer well taken care of could be more valuable than $10,000 worth of advertising.” ~ Jim Rohn

We have been privileged to work with a truly diverse range of clients such as Canon, Landscape Qld, Worldwide Printing and Ray White and equally diverse projects from charity golf days for Stand Tall for PTS (Post Traumatic Stress) to Easter Egg event favours, football “events” to large rustic themed gourmet hampers. 

And just because everybody asks what is a Maven? … “A maven is a trusted expert in a particular field, who seeks to pass knowledge on to others.” ~ Wikipedia
